1
00:00:00,388 --> 00:00:03,588
- Have you been drinking?
- Just tea.

2
00:00:04,493 --> 00:00:07,293
It was the best tea I've ever had.

3
00:00:08,697 --> 00:00:10,027
(Wil:)Why are you here?

4
00:00:10,699 --> 00:00:12,169
(Sheldon:)I'll tell you.

5
00:00:12,334 --> 00:00:14,534
(Sheldon:)I'm from Texas.

6
00:00:15,036 --> 00:00:17,506
(Sheldon:)Need I say more?

7
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:21,300
(Wil:)Yeah, actually,
a little more would be helpful.

8
00:00:21,476 --> 00:00:26,036
(Sheldon:)You insulted my woman.
I'm here to defend her honor.

9
00:00:26,214 --> 00:00:27,644
Two. It was two.

10
00:00:28,316 --> 00:00:30,406
(Sheldon:)Wil Wheaton.

11
00:00:32,921 --> 00:00:36,651
(Sheldon:)Now prepare yourself for what may come.

12
00:00:39,227 --> 00:00:41,957
(Wil:)Oh, Sheldon,
do you really think we're gonna fight?

13
00:00:42,130 --> 00:00:46,290
(Sheldon:)My fists are not up here
because I'm milking a giant invisible cow.

14
00:00:48,203 --> 00:00:51,233
(Sheldon:)They're up to beat an apology out of you.

15
00:00:52,073 --> 00:00:53,473
(Wil:)Okay, I'm sorry.

16
00:00:54,576 --> 00:00:58,026
(Sheldon:)Well, that was a long bus ride
for not very much.

